cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below and also cite the datasets you use."
title: "battery-fault-diagnosis: on-board internal short-circuit / over-discharge detection and alarming"
abstract: >-
  A progressive fault classification and alarm pipeline for on-board BMS:
  healthy / over-discharge / internal short-circuit from voltage and
  temperature time series. Random forest to XGBoost to dilated causal
  convolution (dcnn64, 100% on the time-ordered protocol), PSI input-drift
  monitoring, quantile-envelope alarm design with physics hard rules,
  fault-cell localisation and severity grading, and a runnable CLI tool.
version: 1.4.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ilo-love7/battery-fault-diagnosis"
keywords:
  - battery
  - fault-diagnosis
  - internal-short-circuit
  - over-discharge
  - BMS
  - alarm
  - electric-vehicle
